---
import "../style.css";
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
  <meta name="theme-color" content="#050505" />
  <meta name="description" content="Meet avocadoMini and avokadoPro. Two standalone products that create a wider spatial game experience when paired." />
  <meta property="og:type" content="website" />
  <meta property="og:title" content="avokado — Mini meets Pro" />
  <meta property="og:description" content="Built apart. Better together." />
  <meta property="og:url" content="https://avocado-mini.kirin-999.chatgpt.site/" />
  <meta name="twitter:card" content="summary" />
  <link rel="canonical" href="https://avocado-mini.kirin-999.chatgpt.site/" />
  <title>avokado — Mini meets Pro</title>
  <link rel="icon" href="/images/avokado-metallic-mark.png" type="image/png" />
</head>
<body class="apple-home">
  <a class="skip" href="#main-content">Skip to products</a>
  <header class="apple-home-nav">
    <a class="apple-home-brand" href="/" aria-label="avokado home"><img src="/images/avokado-metallic-mark.png" alt="" />avokado</a>
    <nav aria-label="Primary navigation"><a href="/mini/">avocadoMini</a><a href="/pro/">avokadoPro</a><a href="/install/">RockstarOS</a><a href="/rocket-star/">rocketstar</a><a href="/preorder/">Sales status</a></nav>
  </header>
  <div class="apple-home-banner">avocadoMini meets avokadoPro. <a href="#together">Explore the new system <span aria-hidden="true">›</span></a></div>

  <main id="main-content">
    <section id="together" class="home-promo home-promo-system" aria-labelledby="system-title">
      <div class="home-promo-copy">
        <p>AVOCADOMINI × AVOKADOPRO</p>
        <h1 id="system-title">Built apart.<br />Better together.</h1>
        <span>Mini reads the space. Pro runs the experience.</span>
        <div><a href="/mini/">Explore Mini <span aria-hidden="true">›</span></a><a href="/pro/">Explore Pro <span aria-hidden="true">›</span></a></div>
      </div>
      <img src="/images/avocado-mini-tower20-e3-kit.png" alt="Four avocadoMini towers arranged around the separately sold avokadoPro Hub" fetchpriority="high" />
      <p class="home-promo-note">Each product works on its own. Products are sold separately.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="home-promo home-promo-mini" aria-labelledby="mini-title">
      <div class="home-promo-copy">
        <p>AVOCADOMINI / TOWER20 E3</p>
        <h2 id="mini-title">Start with one.<br />Expand the space.</h2>
        <span>Standalone spatial input from ¥160,000.</span>
        <div><a href="/mini/">Learn more <span aria-hidden="true">›</span></a><a href="/preorder/">View pricing <span aria-hidden="true">›</span></a></div>
      </div>
      <img src="/images/tower20-e3-front-transparent-v2.png" alt="Front view of avocadoMini Tower20 E3" loading="lazy" />
    </section>

    <section class="home-promo home-promo-pro" aria-labelledby="pro-title">
      <div class="home-promo-copy">
        <p>AVOKADOPRO / GAME + SERVICES HUB</p>
        <h2 id="pro-title">Games on its own.<br />More with Mini.</h2>
        <span>Standalone game and services Hub from ¥880,000.</span>
        <div><a href="/pro/">Learn more <span aria-hidden="true">›</span></a><a href="/preorder/">View pricing <span aria-hidden="true">›</span></a></div>
      </div>
      <img src="/images/tower20-e3-highlight-edge-hub-v1.png" alt="avokadoPro Hub connected to avocadoMini towers" loading="lazy" />
    </section>

    <section class="home-tile-grid" aria-label="More from avokado">
      <article class="home-tile home-tile-os"><div><p>ROCKSTAROS</p><h2>One operating foundation.</h2><span>Install and connect approved products.</span><a href="/install/">Open installer <span aria-hidden="true">›</span></a></div><div class="home-os-orbit" aria-hidden="true"></div></article>
      <article class="home-tile home-tile-four"><div><p>FOUR-MINI PACKAGE</p><h2>More viewpoints.<br />One shared space.</h2><span>Four-Mini reference package ¥410,000.</span><a href="/mini/#product">See 180° product story <span aria-hidden="true">›</span></a></div><img src="/images/tower20-e3-highlight-200mm-v1.png" alt="Multiple avocadoMini towers defining a shared play area" loading="lazy" /></article>
      <article class="home-tile home-tile-pair"><div><p>MINI + PRO</p><h2>The room becomes the interface.</h2><span>Pair spatial input with games and services.</span><a href="/pro/#pro-pairing">See how they pair <span aria-hidden="true">›</span></a></div><img src="/images/avocado-mini-tower20-e3-kit-transparent-v2.png" alt="avocadoMini and avokadoPro system" loading="lazy" /></article>
      <article class="home-tile home-tile-rocket"><div><p>ROCKETSTAR</p><h2>Beyond the room.</h2><span>Explore the launch system design.</span><a href="/rocket-star/">Explore rocketstar <span aria-hidden="true">›</span></a></div><img src="/images/rocket-star-orbit.png" alt="rocketstar launch system concept" loading="lazy" /></article>
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer class="apple-home-footer"><p>Reference prices exclude tax and shipping. Product designs and specifications remain subject to validation.</p><div><span>© 2026 avokadinc</span><a href="/mini/">avocadoMini</a><a href="/pro/">avokadoPro</a><a href="/legal/">Sales disclosure</a><a href="/privacy/">Privacy</a><a href="https://github.com/k999ln/rock">Development repository ↗</a></div></footer>
</body>
</html>
